---
alwaysApply: true
---

@rule controller_event_tracking
All controllers MUST include event tracking for important endpoints using @TrackEvent decorator and @UseInterceptors(AnalyticsInterceptor).

## Requirements
- Import required decorators: TrackEvent, AnalyticsInterceptor, ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS
- Add @TrackEvent decorator to ALL important endpoints (CRUD operations, user actions)
- Add @UseInterceptors(AnalyticsInterceptor) to endpoints with @TrackEvent
- Use appropriate event types from ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS.EVENT_TYPES
- Use appropriate categories: CONTENT, SOCIAL, ENGAGEMENT, SYSTEM, USER
- Use appropriate subject types matching the entity

## Event Categories Mapping
- **CONTENT**: articles, series, tags, media, stickers (create/read/update/delete content)
- **SOCIAL**: follow, organizations, users (social interactions, user relationships)
- **ENGAGEMENT**: comments, reactions, bookmarks, shares (user engagement)
- **SYSTEM**: reports, contributions, notifications, qr, auth (system/admin functionality)
- **USER**: users, auth (user management, authentication)

## Required Endpoints to Track
For each entity controller, track these operations:
- CREATE: {entity}_create (POST endpoints)
- VIEW: {entity}_view (GET /:id endpoints)
- LIST: {entity}_list (GET endpoints for collections)
- UPDATE: {entity}_update (PATCH/PUT endpoints)
- DELETE: {entity}_delete (DELETE endpoints)
- Special operations: approve, reject, read, scan, etc.

## Implementation Pattern
```typescript
import { TrackEvent } from 'src/analytics/decorators/track-event.decorator';
import { AnalyticsInterceptor } from 'src/analytics/interceptors/analytics.interceptor';
import { ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS } from 'src/shared/constants/analytics.constants';

@Post()
@TrackEvent(
  ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS.EVENT_TYPES.ENTITY_CREATE,
  ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS.EVENT_CATEGORIES.CONTENT, // or SOCIAL/ENGAGEMENT/SYSTEM/USER
  ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS.SUBJECT_TYPES.ENTITY,
)
@UseInterceptors(AnalyticsInterceptor)
@Auth()
async create(@Body() dto: CreateDto) {
  return this.service.create(dto);
}
```

## Exceptions
- Do NOT track health check endpoints
- Do NOT track internal/admin stats endpoints
- Do NOT track low-value read-only endpoints (metadata, exists checks)
- Skip tracking if endpoint is purely for debugging/testing

## Validation Checklist
- [ ] All CRUD endpoints have @TrackEvent decorators
- [ ] All tracked endpoints have @UseInterceptors(AnalyticsInterceptor)
- [ ] Event types match ANALYTICS_CONSTANTS.EVENT_TYPES
- [ ] Categories and subject types are appropriate
- [ ] Imports are present at top of file
- [ ] No business logic mixed with tracking decorators